    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2909" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκανθ-ίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>,
			ἡ, a bird, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>goldfinch, Fringilla carduelis</i>, or <i>linnet,
				Fr.linaria</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				616b31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				7.141
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠριγέρων</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				25.168
			</span></i>: 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκανθα Ἀραβική</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.13
			</span></i>: 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκάνθιον</span>
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κανθός</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				17(1).666
			</span></i>.</div>
